/* ===== QUIZ WIDGET STYLES ===== */
/* De-gamified: dashboard Daily Quiz card removed in the quiet-recognition redesign.
   (Was force-visible to override card-hidden; now authoritatively hidden at the source.) */
#quizWidget {
