   (item 19) First-run onboarding reskinned to cream / ink / single crimson.
   Gold stays only as the small progress accent + selection outline.
   ============================================================ */
.welcome-tour-overlay{background:var(--paper) !important;}
.welcome-splash-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--paper) 0%,var(--paper-2) 100%) !important;}
